# 🧭 Master Component Analysis Playbook — CodeMind IDE

> **Purpose:** Instruct the CodeMind AI agent to analyze **one or two repositories simultaneously**
> and produce a single, unified, richly-formatted Markdown report covering:
> architectural taxonomy, functional use case inventory, data flow analysis,
> CI/CD pipeline mapping, business rules, test coverage, traceability, and gaps.
>
> **Zero hardcoding. Every value derived from repository contents. Both repos analyzed
> side-by-side when two are provided. One report file output.**

