  What:   Exact action (e.g., "Add @ExceptionHandler for XyzException in GlobalExceptionHandler.java")
  Where:  Specific file, class, or pipeline stage
  Why:    Impact of not doing it (from gap finding)
  Effort: S (< 1 day) / M (1–3 days) / L (> 3 days)
